From: elfring@users.sourceforge.net (SF Markus Elfring)
Date: Mon, 15 Aug 2016 19:38:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] MIPS: pci-mt7620: Delete unnecessary assignment for the field
 "owner"
Message-ID: <41bba93a-24bd-d12d-016b-79469e8c15f3@users.sourceforge.net>
To: linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org
List-Id: linux-arm-kernel.lists.infradead.org

From: Markus Elfring <elfring@users.sourceforge.net>
Date: Mon, 15 Aug 2016 19:29:09 +0200

The field "owner" is set by the core.
Thus delete an unneeded initialisation.

Generated by: scripts/coccinelle/api/platform_no_drv_owner.cocci
Signed-off-by: Markus Elfring <elfring@users.sourceforge.net>
---
 arch/mips/pci/pci-mt7620.c | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/mips/pci/pci-mt7620.c b/arch/mips/pci/pci-mt7620.c
index 6ce8162..eb39826 100644
--- a/arch/mips/pci/pci-mt7620.c
+++ b/arch/mips/pci/pci-mt7620.c
@@ -413,7 +413,6 @@ static struct platform_driver mt7620_pci_driver = {
 	.probe = mt7620_pci_probe,
 	.driver = {
 		.name = "mt7620-pci",
-		.owner = THIS_MODULE,
 		.of_match_table = of_match_ptr(mt7620_pci_ids),
 	},
 };
-- 
